(7608362, 1230551, 50695, '<td valign="top">ok, we need to talk about this. confetti in the gutter is an image that''s haunted me for decades. I think Philip Levine used this image but I haven''t been able to find it. And while we''re talking about unfound poems, there''s also a poem about a Roman Emperor who was used as a footstool. Can''t find that one, either. True story, though. Look it up. You''ll find him. But not the poem.</td>', 'ok, we need to talk about this. confetti in the gutter is an image that''s haunted me for decades. I think Philip Levine used this image but I haven''t been able to find it. And while we''re talking about unfound poems, there''s also a poem about a Roman Emperor who was used as a footstool. Can''t find that one, either. True story, though. Look it up. You''ll find him. But not the poem.', '2019-01-13 23:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
