(7608382, 1230534, 141319, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your nice comments :-). I was struggling a bit with the challenge theme, so am double chuffed with the ribbon. My girls are always willing models. The little Jack Russel type, Allez, is 15 years old and still wants to be center of any and all activity :-).</td>', 'Thank you all for your nice comments :-). I was struggling a bit with the challenge theme, so am double chuffed with the ribbon. My girls are always willing models. The little Jack Russel type, Allez, is 15 years old and still wants to be center of any and all activity :-).', '2019-01-14 05:28:29.000000', NULL, 0),
