(7608384, 1230556, 141319, '<td valign="top">Not sure how much "joy" there was for mum washing the chocolate out of the dress ;-P, but the model sure had lots of joy - you can see its real! :-) Very cute image.</td>', 'Not sure how much "joy" there was for mum washing the chocolate out of the dress ;-P, but the model sure had lots of joy - you can see its real! :-) Very cute image.', '2019-01-14 05:32:05.000000', NULL, 0),
