(7608399, 1230551, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes the images of children, especially Anita''s glorious entry, are charming and endearing.  Still, there is no less charm in the casual serendipity of this glint of sidewalk color, and its unexpected appearance.  And we smile even more broadly to be in this world.</td>', 'Yes the images of children, especially Anita''s glorious entry, are charming and endearing.  Still, there is no less charm in the casual serendipity of this glint of sidewalk color, and its unexpected appearance.  And we smile even more broadly to be in this world.', '2019-01-14 07:42:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7608404, 1230556, 59029, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s Emilie? I know it''s trite to say but has she ever grown! And I can definitely see you in her features :-) Fun shot, lovely. Congrats on the HM :-)<br/></td>', 'Wow, that''s Emilie? I know it''s trite to say but has she ever grown! And I can definitely see you in her features :-) Fun shot, lovely. Congrats on the HM :-)', '2019-01-14 10:04:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7608405, 1230526, 135744, '<td valign="top">Congrats Anita. Superb photo that really captures a special moment. You are brave to take photos of strangers - I am a bit wary of taking photos of strangers without their permission especially when kids are in the mix. Guess it is a sad state the world is in these days though having said that I wouldn''t want a stranger taking a photo of me and my daughter.</td>', 'Congrats Anita. Superb photo that really captures a special moment. You are brave to take photos of strangers - I am a bit wary of taking photos of strangers without their permission especially when kids are in the mix. Guess it is a sad state the world is in these days though having said that I wouldn''t want a stranger taking a photo of me and my daughter.', '2019-01-14 10:32:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7608423, 1230556, 86447, '<td valign="top">Emilie looks like a bundle of fun, Christophe!  I''m so glad you have such a willing model.  It doesn''t hurt that she''s beautiful either.  Ha!<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your HM!<br/></td>', 'Emilie looks like a bundle of fun, Christophe!  I''m so glad you have such a willing model.  It doesn''t hurt that she''s beautiful either.  Ha! Congratulations on your HM!', '2019-01-14 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
